# Oengo Web Storefront Developer & AI Agent Rules
# MANDATORY FOR ALL AI AGENTS & DEVELOPERS

## Core Principles
1. ZERO-BUG & BUILD PASSING MANDATE:
   - Always run `npm run build` (`next build`) before any commit.
   - Zero compilation errors and zero build warnings allowed.
   - Pushing unverified or failing code to `main` is strictly forbidden.

2. SECURITY & WALLET SAFETY:
   - Never hardcode private keys or secrets in the client application.
   - Ensure all transaction signing flows request explicit user confirmation.
   - See `DEVELOPER_AND_AI_RULES.md` for complete enforcement policies.
